  *  - the device is in UFS-PowerDown, so every LU answers NOT READY (sense 02/04/02).
  * Runtime state only: a reset clears it. Wake sequence and register facts from
  * rootstockos/NativeUfs (BSD-2-Clause-Patent) and Linux ufshcd_set_dev_pwr_mode. MMU off: all memory is Device, DMA needs no cache
